2. Icons under CC-BY-SA-4.0
---------------------------

Rendered at 16px and 32px from adwaita-icon-theme's pan-up, pan-down and
pan-end symbolic icons, which Debian's adwaita-icon-theme copyright file
lists under the Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International
license (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/):

  Resources/ThemeImages/          adwaita-icon-theme
  NSAscendingSortIndicator.tiff    pan-up-symbolic
  NSDescendingSortIndicator.tiff   pan-down-symbolic
  GnomeThemeBranch-symbolic.tiff   pan-end-symbolic


Changes: each icon was rasterized at 16px and 32px into one TIFF (the
cursors converted from Xcursor to TIFF) and renamed to the GNUstep image name the theme replaces.
The theme tints the symbolic ones to the text colour when it draws them.
